"""
HV PULSE STUDIO  -  TG10 -> DPB1-1000-3.0-Al driver -> BBO Pockels cell

Plain-language planner for the two driver inputs:
    X1 only      (jumper #7 pos.1): X1 rising = HV ON, X1 falling = HV OFF
    X1 + X2      (jumper #7 pos.2): X1 rising = HV ON, X2 rising = HV OFF

Put this file next to main1.py (same folder as TG10_CAN_DIR). Open with:
    from pulse_studio import PulseStudioDialog
    PulseStudioDialog(self).show()          # self = TG10Window

Standalone test (no hardware):  python pulse_studio.py
"""
